  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "UniICL-760K",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tUniICL-760K\n\t\n\n\n  \n    \n  \n  \n    \n  \n  \n    \n  \n  \n    \n  \n\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tOverview\n\t\n\n\nWe introduce UniICL-760K, the first large-scale dataset specifically designed for unified multimodal In-context learning across visual understanding and generation. It contains 766,868 carefully constructed ICL episodes, each paired with a curated 8-shot demonstration context. Rather than fragmenting tasks by isolated application goals, UniICL-760K organizes understanding and generation within a\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/xuyicheng-zju/UniICL-760K.",
